QvPalette Terms of Use
Last updated: November 5, 2026

Copyright (c) 2026 やきたてぐらふてぃ (Negiyaki). All rights reserved.

By downloading or using this package (hereinafter "this Asset"), you shall be deemed to have agreed to these Terms.

1. Permitted Uses
   a. Incorporating this Asset into a VRChat world and uploading or publishing that world, whether Private or Public.
      Use in commercial worlds and event worlds is also permitted. For use as a corporate entity, please consult the Distributor individually.
   b. Modifying or customizing this Asset to fit the specifications, design, key assignments, etc. of your own world.
   c. Video recording, streaming, and posting to social media (including monetization) in a world that incorporates this Asset. Credit attribution is optional.

2. Prohibited Uses
   a. Making this Asset itself, or a modified version of it, available for download by third parties anywhere other than the Distributor (Yakigura/vpm-qvpalette, Yakigura/QvPalette, Yakigura/QvInkPreview, and the BOOTH distribution page)
      (including redistribution, resale, re-sharing of the UnityPackage, publication in a public repository or VPM listing, and incorporation into a Public avatar).
   b. Violating Article 6 (Prohibition of Analysis Using Generative AI, etc.) or Article 7 (Prohibition of Reverse Engineering, etc.).
   c. Use intended to obstruct other players' view, to grief, or to cause excessive load or crashes,
      or use for purposes contrary to laws and regulations or to public order and morals.
   d. Misrepresenting all or any part of this Asset as your own work.
   e. Contacting the creator of QvPen (ureishi) regarding the specifications, installation, bugs, requests, etc. of this Asset.
      Inquiries shall be directed to the Distributor of this Asset (developer: Negiyaki).

3. Use in Commissioned Production
   When delivering this Asset to a third party together with a Unity project, such as in commissioned production work, both the client and the contractor
   must have legitimately obtained this Asset.

4. About QvPen
   This Asset is an unofficial extension of QvPen. QvPen is separate software, and its copyright and license
   belong to the creator of QvPen. These Terms do not apply to QvPen. Users shall also comply with the terms of QvPen.

5. About the Use of Generative AI
   Generative AI was used in part of the production process of this Asset.
   Generative AI was used as an aid to production; the final design, implementation, verification, and adjustment were performed by the author.

6. Prohibition of Analysis Using Generative AI, etc.
   Users shall not input, transmit, or upload all or any part of this Asset to generative AI, AI agents, machine learning services, code analysis services, or any other similar services
   for the purpose of analyzing the internal structure, implementation methods, algorithms, operating principles, or other technical content of this Asset.
   The scope of this prohibition includes the following:
     ・Source code and scripts
     ・The UnityPackage and any other files included in this Asset (including Prefabs, scenes, configuration files, and data)
     ・Configuration data specific to this Asset
     ・Information required to examine or reproduce the internal implementation of this Asset
     ・Any other information provided for the purpose of analyzing, duplicating, or imitating this Asset
   Furthermore, analyzing, reproducing, duplicating, or imitating functions, internal structures, implementation methods, etc. identical or similar to those of this Asset
   by using AI or other tools is prohibited.
   However, the following are not prohibited:
     ・Consulting AI about general error messages displayed during normal use of this Asset, or about general
       technical matters relating to Unity or VRChat.
     ・Temporarily inputting part of this Asset into a development support tool for the purpose of installing it into, or debugging it in, the user's own world
       (this does not include use for training, provision to third parties, or use in creating similar products).
   Even in these cases, this Asset may not be used for creating similar products or for training AI.

7. Prohibition of Reverse Engineering, etc.
   Except where permitted by law, users shall not perform the following acts with respect to this Asset:
     ・Reverse engineering, decompiling, or disassembling
     ・Analysis for the purpose of extracting or reproducing implementation methods
     ・Any other acts similar to the above
   Modifying the scripts included in this Asset to fit your own world (Article 1 b) is not
   subject to this Article.

8. Disclaimer
   This Asset is provided "as is." The creator shall not be liable for any trouble or damage arising from the use of this Asset.
   This Asset may stop working without notice due to updates to VRChat or QvPen.

9. Changes
   These Terms may be changed in future versions or at any time. The changed Terms shall apply to all versions, including versions already obtained,
   from the time they are posted on the distribution page and in the Distributor's repository. If you use this Asset after a change, you shall be deemed to have agreed to the changed Terms.
   Please check the latest Terms on the distribution page and in the Distributor's repository (LICENSE in Yakigura/QvPalette).

